I’m applying the implementation and test skills. I’ll keep Dart’s existing behavior, add the five tower definitions from the local wiki data, and mark ambiguous stats with `// uncertain:` comments. Placement checks will live in the simulation and be enforced by the shop; the existing `addTower` test setup API will remain compatible.
